"""Interactive opportunity inventory and diagnostic geometry comparisons."""
import argparse,json
from pathlib import Path

NOTES={
 'Fans':'All 1,607 source faces are unstyled; the earlier global policy froze all geometry. An explicit fan-only LOD exception preserves the neutral fallback and provenance. 102 small-bore candidates remain; none are intentionally closed.',
 'Energy Units':'76% of current triangles were frozen by colour policy, including cream and unstyled surfaces. One enclosed cavity is qualified by native containment with 0.2 mm minimum clearance. Cavity-only images match the current mesh exactly in all 14 views.',
 'Resource mechanisms':'76% of current geometry is unstyled and frozen. Native shell 4 alone has 52,142 current triangles. Three multi-shell solids fail enclosure qualification; none of those shells are removed.',
 'Tech Core tool heads':'The largest current shell is a copper-coloured plate: 13,056 triangles, 155 × 434 × 9.3 mm. Source colours are authored, not debug colours. The 390 source groups import as 1,600 native shells; preserve source grouping when coalescing fragments.',
 'Rune':'Coarser native tessellation grows the complete model by 178,045 triangles. 109,652 current triangles lie in native shells no larger than 17 mm, and 3,368 complete small-bore candidates were discovered. Size alone does not authorize removing them; protect target/light outlines and qualify local hardware/backing edits.'}

def main():
    ap=argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__);ap.add_argument('out',type=Path);a=ap.parse_args();out=a.out.resolve();report=json.loads((out/'review.json').read_bytes());cavity=json.loads((out/'cavity-preview.json').read_bytes());rows=sorted(report['groups'],key=lambda r:['Fans','Energy Units','Resource mechanisms','Tech Core tool heads','Rune'].index(r['group']));fan=report['fan_trial'];views=sorted({x['view'] for r in rows for x in r['views']},key=lambda s:(s!='e15-a45',s));paths={};table=''
    for r in rows:
        name=r['group'];stages=['current','angular']+(['fan-lod'] if name=='Fans' else ['cavity-only','angular-cavity'] if name=='Energy Units' else []);paths[name]={stage:{view:str(out/'review'/name/(stage+'-'+view+'.png')) for view in views} for stage in stages};saving=fan['placed_saving'] if name=='Fans' else r['current_placed_triangles']-cavity['counts']['angular-cavity']*12 if name=='Energy Units' else max(0,r['current_placed_triangles']-r['angular_placed_triangles']);r['tested_saving']=saving;table+=f'<tr><td>{name}</td><td>{r["current_placed_triangles"]:,}</td><td>{r["current_frozen_placed_triangles"]/r["current_placed_triangles"]:.0%}</td><td>{saving:,}</td></tr>'
    total=sum(r['tested_saving'] for r in rows)
    page='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font:14px var(--font-sans,system-ui);color:var(--foreground);line-height:1.5}h2{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:20px}p{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.stats div{padding:16px;background:var(--secondary);border-radius:10px}.stats b{display:block;font-size:24px}.stats span{font-size:12px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px 0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}td,th{padding:8px 4px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}td:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left}select{padding:7px;background:var(--secondary);color:var(--foreground);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;margin:5px 7px 10px 0}.images{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}figure{margin:0}img{width:100%;border-radius:8px}figcaption,.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground)}#finding{padding:16px;background:var(--secondary);border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0}@media(max-width:500px){table{font-size:11px}.stats div{padding:10px}.stats b{font-size:19px}}</style></head><body>
<h2>Where the remaining geometry goes</h2><div class="stats"><div><b>1.645M</b><span>Placed triangles in these five targets</span></div><div><b>TOTAL</b><span>Measured diagnostic opportunity</span></div><div><b>55,488</b><span>Current Energy cavity triangles</span></div></div>
<p>“Frozen” means the earlier conservative policy retained chromatic or unstyled geometry. That does not establish a light, artwork or gameplay role. Every original occurrence is counted.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Target</th><th>Current placed</th><th>Frozen</th><th>Tested saving</th></tr></thead><tbody>TABLE</tbody></table>
<p class="note">Tested savings combine the fan-specific LOD trial, Energy coarse tessellation + qualified cavity omission, and coarser native tessellation for the resource mechanism and tool head. These choices have not been adopted into the approved field. Rune's general coarse-tessellation trial is larger, so contributes no saving here.</p>
<select id="group">GROUPS</select><select id="stage"></select><select id="view">VIEWS</select><div id="finding"></div>
<div class="images"><figure><img id="before"><figcaption>Approved current geometry</figcaption></figure><figure><img id="after"><figcaption id="caption"></figcaption></figure></div><p id="metric"></p>
<p class="note">Source CAD and installed assets remain unchanged. Native trials keep every original face and its colour binding while changing mesh density; protected light geometry and interpolated shading are not bit-exact. The fan trial retains fallback provenance. Energy cavity-only retains exact exterior GLB positions, normals and materials. Fourteen fixed-pose flat diagnostic views and sampled distances do not certify all motion, PBR or continuous surface error.</p>
<script>const rows=ROWS,paths=PATHS,notes=NOTES,cavity=CAVITY;const labels={angular:'Native tessellation: 0.4 mm / 0.6 rad','fan-lod':'Fan-only LOD: 0.25 mm / 1 mm guard','cavity-only':'Energy: cavity omission only','angular-cavity':'Energy: coarse tessellation + cavity omission'};function updateGroup(){let group=document.querySelector('#group').value,select=document.querySelector('#stage');select.innerHTML=Object.keys(paths[group]).filter(x=>x!=='current').map(x=>`<option value="${x}">${labels[x]}</option>`).join('');select.value=group==='Fans'?'fan-lod':group==='Energy Units'?'angular-cavity':'angular';update();}function update(){let group=document.querySelector('#group').value,stage=document.querySelector('#stage').value,view=document.querySelector('#view').value,row=rows.find(r=>r.group===group);document.querySelector('#finding').textContent=notes[group];document.querySelector('#before').src=paths[group].current[view];document.querySelector('#after').src=paths[group][stage][view];document.querySelector('#caption').textContent=labels[stage];let metrics=stage==='cavity-only'||stage==='angular-cavity'?cavity.views:row.views,m=metrics.find(x=>x.stage===stage&&x.view===view);document.querySelector('#metric').textContent=`This view: foreground-mask difference ${(m.foreground_difference_relative_fraction*100).toFixed(3)}%; image pixels changing by >10/255 ${(m.rgb_changed_over_10_fraction*100).toFixed(3)}%.`;};document.querySelector('#group').onchange=updateGroup;document.querySelector('#stage').onchange=update;document.querySelector('#view').onchange=update;updateGroup();</script></body></html>'''
    page=page.replace('TOTAL',f'{total:,}').replace('TABLE',table).replace('GROUPS',''.join('<option>'+r['group']+'</option>' for r in rows)).replace('VIEWS',''.join('<option>'+v+'</option>' for v in views)).replace('ROWS',json.dumps(rows)).replace('PATHS',json.dumps(paths)).replace('NOTES',json.dumps(NOTES)).replace('CAVITY',json.dumps(cavity));(out/'review.html').write_text(page)

if __name__=='__main__':main()
